{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.poster.avif?t=1756823133\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.webm?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.mp4?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis is a fast-paced tactical card-flipping CCG, where heroes and villains face off as worlds collide! Draft a hand of champions from different worlds, each with their own unique stories, abilities and connections. Battle your opponents' cards and flip them to your side as you take control of the board.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIP YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.poster.avif?t=1756823133\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.webm?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/dcb5ab05e298a2b325170d2a98024777.mp4?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you place a card next to an opponent\u2019s, higher adjacent edges let you flip that card to your side and gain points. When the board is full or all players are out of cards, the player with the most points wins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLDS COLLIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a hand of cards made up of heroes &amp; villains from different worlds, each with their own stories and Archetypes. Fighters, Protectors, Instigators, and Specialists provide opportunities to move across the board, rotate cards, stop capture, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH POWERFUL DYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.poster.avif?t=1756823133\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.webm?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/70dcc07e8eafb747d8f4149b3cbe0473.mp4?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamics can be activated when certain characters appear together on the board, bringing their intertwined narratives into play. Whether supporting allies or manipulating rivals, these dynamic interactions can quickly turn the tide of each match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY SOLO OR BATTLE YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skills by completing a variety of single-player trials, or create an arena where up to 4 players can battle against each other. Will you cleverly outmaneuver your foes, or will your cards be turned against you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR COLLECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.poster.avif?t=1756823133\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.webm?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/eda5229e3cc4b0d74b6b7fc3311aae87.mp4?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versalis has over 50 unique cards to collect, plus different rarities and special alternate art versions. Win booster packs by playing matches and completing trials, or convert duplicate cards into tokens you can use to craft the specific cards you need.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812220?t=1756823133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812220?t=1756823133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/01749d09b55a19d10ea3553cb1c6a572a9dbd1fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756823133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/01749d09b55a19d10ea3553cb1c6a572a9dbd1fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756823133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.poster.avif?t=1756823133\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812220/extras/6c5dac8fccf008bceeb127209dfaae27.webm?t=1756823133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste